  lionctl ensure-running  # ensure core agents are running
  lionctl qvillage-autodev # run qvillage autodevelop tasks (dry-run)
  lionctl quantum-sync    # sync quantum modules and datasets (dry-run)
  lionctl qstore-sync     # sync qstore data and indexes (dry-run)
  lionctl whatsapp-hooks  # validate WhatsApp integration hooks (dry-run)
  lionctl revenue-audit   # run revenue spec generation and basic checks (dry-run)
  lionctl wallets-audit   # check wallets, testnets and reconciliation (dry-run)
  lionctl biometrics-check# run biometrics/login page checks (dry-run)
  lionctl deals-automate  # simulate/validate automated deals automation flows (dry-run)

Notes:
 - This is a safe scaffold. Commands show actions and recommended commands but do not mutate state unless explicitly implemented.
 - For destructive operations, implement explicit `--apply` flags and backup steps.
EOF
}

